  "bodyHash": "7d6ff349f6d64ccf",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>魔法坩堝 ⚜️</h1>\n<p><strong>此模組</strong>&nbsp;為《我的世界》增添了<strong>魔法坩堝雕像</strong>，分佈於<strong>主世界生物群落</strong>中，為<strong>原版遊戲</strong>帶來更豐富的背景設定。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/838bfe897596ae580fb98e66f8f51e623a1862da.jpeg\" alt=\"魔法坩堝宣傳圖\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Moairium &copy; - 2026</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>備註📝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>魔法坩堝</strong>與<strong>1.20 至 26.1</strong>版本<strong>相容</strong>🏷️</li>\n<li><strong>魔法坩堝</strong>為世界生成新增了新的雕像<strong>（結構）</strong>🌐</li>\n<li><strong>魔法坩堝</strong>與任何<strong>世界生成數據包</strong>均相容</li>\n<li><strong>不需要</strong>對下載的檔案進行<strong>解壓縮</strong>🗂️</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>世界生成🌐</h2>\n<p><strong>每個生物群落</strong>都有獨特的生成模式，各群落之間會有所不同。以下列出各生物群落及其對應的<strong>魔法坩堝</strong>範例：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>深色森林 - 魔法坩堝</p>\n<p><strong>若想使用指令尋找</strong>，請輸入：<code>/locate structure moairium:dark_forest_magic_cauldron</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"深色橡樹樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/83180828dd5cea62ff32660fedfbe0cfcf559718.jpeg\" alt=\"深色森林坩堝\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"深色橡樹樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群落生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:dark_forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>櫻花林 - 魔法坩堝</p>\n<p><strong>若想使用指令尋找</strong>，請輸入：<code>/locate structure moairium:cherry_magic_cauldron</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7d83635524a41412b5f7b37ac1464e4d3102e79d.png\" alt=\"櫻花樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b35072e44a68d9f3d9c9a55ffa71c947c1791a37.jpeg\" alt=\"櫻花坩堝\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7d83635524a41412b5f7b37ac1464e4d3102e79d.png\" alt=\"櫻花樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群落生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:cherry_grove\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>熱帶草原 - 魔法坩堝</p>\n<p><strong>若想使用指令尋找</strong>，請輸入：<code>/locate structure moairium:savanna_magic_cauldron</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b33943d5396e6b6eb4e92a1a56778ab6bf87a2af.png\" alt=\"金合歡樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/85deae18aa6069a7c730f9dcd3ef752dae7d6dd2.jpeg\" alt=\"熱帶草原坩堝\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b33943d5396e6b6eb4e92a1a56778ab6bf87a2af.png\" alt=\"金合歡樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群落生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:savanna_plateau\",\n\n\"minecraft:savanna\",\n\n\"minecraft:windswept_savanna\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>蒼白花園 - 魔法坩堝</p>\n<p><strong>若想使用指令尋找</strong>，請輸入：<code>/locate structure moairium:pale_garden_magic_cauldron</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc9524f555fe5dbef01a0ce397246c00b5d87a4d.png\" alt=\"蒼白橡樹樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a7accabff972457bbdd9f193167d1e09b491eb98.jpeg\" alt=\"蒼白花園坩堝\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc9524f555fe5dbef01a0ce397246c00b5d87a4d.png\" alt=\"蒼白橡樹樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群落生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:pale_garden\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>叢林 - 魔法坩堝</p>\n<p><strong>若想使用指令尋找</strong>，請輸入：<code>/locate structure moairium:jungle_magic_cauldron</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b1aa9433f6c385506d287e16f362375a0c1d31.png\" alt=\"叢林樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a5c1dc6b2cb62636c549e12d31a00a1e316e3bfa.jpeg\" alt=\"叢林坩堝\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b1aa9433f6c385506d287e16f362375a0c1d31.png\" alt=\"叢林樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群落生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:bamboo_jungle\",\n\n\"minecraft:jungle\",\n\n\"minecraft:sparse_jungle\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>紅樹林 - 魔法坩堝</p>\n<p><strong>若想使用指令尋找</strong>，請輸入：<code>/locate structure moairium:mangrove_magic_cauldron</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cffdde27cab475339f2225353bac1455dc41c408.png\" alt=\"紅樹林繁殖體\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/33d46ae8e9ff8ae75f4f270bb74e5272edbeaac5.jpeg\" alt=\"紅樹林坩堝\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cffdde27cab475339f2225353bac1455dc41c408.png\" alt=\"紅樹林繁殖體\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群落生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:mangrove_swamp\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>沼澤 - 魔法坩堝</p>\n<p><strong>若想使用指令尋找</strong>，請輸入：<code>/locate structure moairium:swamp_magic_cauldron</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡樹樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/072713b76b877fce1a4913e55ba0b8fa6c4437b0.jpeg\" alt=\"沼澤坩堝\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡樹樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群落生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:swamp\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>樺木林 - 魔法坩堝</p>\n<p><strong>若想使用指令尋找</strong>，請輸入：<code>/locate structure moairium:birch_magic_cauldron</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/891598a8447572b25572d29d96741faecd32ae40.png\" alt=\"樺樹樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/838bfe897596ae580fb98e66f8f51e623a1862da.jpeg\" alt=\"樺木坩堝\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/891598a8447572b25572d29d96741faecd32ae40.png\" alt=\"樺樹樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群落生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:birch_forest\",\n\n\"minecraft:old_growth_birch_forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>橡木林 - 魔法坩堝</p>\n<p><strong>若想使用指令尋找</strong>，請輸入：<code>/locate structure moairium:forest_magic_cauldron</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡樹樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b5f65ea3f19121af05b6351f2aa85d50b02b493.jpeg\" alt=\"橡木林坩堝\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡樹樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群落生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:forest\",\n\n\"minecraft:meadow\",\n\n\"minecraft:sunflower_plains\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>針葉林 - 魔法坩堝</p>\n<p><strong>若想使用指令尋找</strong>，請輸入：<code>/locate structure moairium:taiga_magic_cauldron</code></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e854f3fdbf494018ea51d86262a8ada8fa77931e.png\" alt=\"雲杉樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b5f65ea3f19121af05b6351f2aa85d50b02b493.jpeg\" alt=\"針葉林坩堝\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e854f3fdbf494018ea51d86262a8ada8fa77931e.png\" alt=\"雲杉樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群落生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:taiga\",\n\n\"minecraft:old_growth_pine_taiga\",\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
